Package: MyIntroCalculations
Title: Introductory Calculation Helpers for Everyday Math and Simple Algebra
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Max", "De Cuba", email = "mjdecuba@usf.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    A small collection of functions for basic arithmetic, averages,
    distances, percentages, weighted means, simple interest, compound
    interest, and solving one-variable linear equations. The examples
    are aimed at students in introductory R and math courses who want
    clear, defensively-programmed calculation helpers.
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
